    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 12
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>The Cerberus Gunship is a heavily-armored, rapid-response combat aircraft used as a recurring antagonist against Shepard's team. It strafe-runs with rockets and a mass accelerator cannon. Its heavy shields and armor make it extremely difficult to bring down with small arms - heavy weapons and biotics are recommended. The pilot can be targeted through the cockpit windscreen.</p>",
